# An allowlist: the build context is only the web image's needs (docker/web/Dockerfile).
# Everything else — docs, the dump, .env, node_modules, the 36 KB original data blob —
# stays out of the context, so it can never be copied into an image by accident.
*
!index.html
!package.json
!src/
!_ds/
!vendor/
!tests/fixtures/
!scripts/serve.mjs
**/*:Zone.Identifier
